<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Tea 12-mth net up 120 pct.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Tea 12-mth net up 120 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Ceylon Tea Services Ltd for the year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	  (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  1997		 1996</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,078.02    vs    465.37</p>
<p>    Net profit		138.43    vs     62.91</p>
<p>    Tax provision	    15.00    vs	0.81</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Tea Services exports value added teas, mainly tea bags.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
